 emselves. This is an opportunity to read it for yourself over coffee or te
 a. No preaching\, no assumptions\, and no prior background required\, just
  open dialogue.\n\nFAQ's \n\nQ: What is Scripture Reading?\n\nA: Time to r
 ead through the bible\n\nQ: Who is invited?\n\nA: All UCSD students (under
 grads & grads) are welcome to join\, no prior background required. Sign up
